1
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Ruyi, wake up. Ruyi...!

2
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:04,400
Open the gate!
Open the gate...!

3
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:07,160
Where are you off to?

4
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:10,400
We were told that Mei Shouquan
was making drugs to save lives

5
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:12,400
We want to go out and see him

6
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:15,000
Nobody is allowed to leave
without the Magistrate's approval

7
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:16,400
We're patients and not criminals

8
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:19,160
We can go anywhere we like.
Make way...!

9
00:02:26,160 --> 00:02:30,400
Halt!
What's all this noise?!

10
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:37,160
Sir, why are you blowing your top?
It isn't good for your health!

11
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,400
Cut all that crap!

12
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:44,000
Our request is very simple - let Shou
have peace of mind in making his drugs

13
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:48,120
Let us see him.
I may be able to help him

14
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,400
It's good for everybody, isn't it?

15
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:55,000
Mei Shouquan is doing something
for the kingdom

16
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,120
Will you bear the responsibility
if it goes awry?

17
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,400
What I know is
Shou and I are sworn brothers

18
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:03,400
We're like my left and right arms,
never separated

19
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,400
I want to see nobody else but him!

20
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:11,400
He who makes trouble
will have his family decimented!

21
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:15,000
Let's go home!

22
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:26,400
Trouble-makers!
I want you to keep an eye on them!

23
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,160
Shuangxi, take this medicine

24
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:34,400
Do you know
Shou has come back?

25
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:37,160
Has Brother really come back?

26
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:41,400
People out there say
he's indeed found the drug cauldron

27
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,400
Is it true?
That's great

28
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:48,160
A pity we're kept in here

29
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:51,160
We don't know
how he's doing right now

30
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:56,120
That Chen Daqi behaved like a general
and refused to let us leave

31
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:59,000
You needn't worry

32
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:03,000
I believe he will be fine
with Sister Ruyi by his side

33
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,120
That's our wish too

34
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:11,400
Other than worrying about other people,
you need to be on your guard too

35
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:13,400
What can happen to me?

36
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:18,160
You are with those patients
all the time

37
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:23,000
You may not have been infected
but the disease is contagious

38
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:28,160
-What if you...
-Don't you worry

39
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:33,400
I've always been in good health.
I will not get infected

40
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:36,160
Don't you be over-confident

41
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:41,000
Let me remind you - your lucky star
has not been shining on you

42
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:44,400
Indeed my luck hasn't been so food

43
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:50,400
However, it's been getting better
ever since you gave me this pouch

44
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,160
Really?

45
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:59,400
Let me present you with the blessings
I've been offered these few days

46
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:02,160
I believe you'll get well soon

47
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:07,000
What will happen to you
if you give me all the blessings?

48
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:14,000
Shuangxi, what are those blessings
to me if I don't even have you?

49
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:18,160
You're my greatest blessing

50
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:21,400
You're my greatest blessing too

51
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:27,120
Why don't we share the blessings
in this blessed pouch?

52
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:31,400
It's sharing of happiness

53
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:36,000
It's good to share happiness
but never illnesses

54
00:05:49,400 --> 00:05:52,400
Ruyi!
Ruyi, wake up!

55
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:58,160
What's happened to your face?!

56
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:13,000
Ruyi, how did your face
become like that?

57
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:18,160
I'm like a monster. I don't wish
to see you. Go out...!

58
00:06:21,400 --> 00:06:23,000
Open the door!

59
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:25,160
You must be thinking
how awful I look, right?

60
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:28,120
To tell you frankly,
if it was in the past,

61
00:06:28,400 --> 00:06:32,400
I would be scared stiff if I were
to see you with the freckles

62
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,000
But after the rough patches
and difficulties...

63
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:42,000
we'd been through on the way
from Ping'an to the Eastern Sea,

64
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:45,720
it dawned on me
you're a marvellous girl

65
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:50,120
You're intelligent, smart
and kind-hearted

66
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:54,000
Looks to you are no longer
so important

67
00:06:55,000 --> 00:07:00,400
I will not abandon you even if
your face was covered with boils

68
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,400
I don't believe you.
You're trying to console me

69
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:07,400
I'm not. I will prove you wrong
if you don't believe me

70
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:09,160
What do you intend to do?

71
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:11,400
I will tell my mother
we will get married!

72
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,800
Stop spouting nonsense!

73
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,800
You promised to marry me
when God of Plague wounded me

74
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,120
Are you backtracking?

75
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:22,400
I never said I'd marry you

76
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:30,400
If you don't share my view,
why are you blushing?

77
00:07:32,400 --> 00:07:36,000
I'm feeling warm, that's all.
Stop talking nonsense...

78
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,400
Fine, I won't force you

79
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:44,000
No matter what you've changed into,
to me you'll always be the best

80
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:48,160
Are you serious?

81
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:51,400
If what I've said
contains any fallacy, I will...

82
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:56,000
No more ominous remarks.
I'll take you at your word

83
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,800
Zhang Guolao, come on out!

84
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:01,800
Come on out, Zhang Guolao!

85
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:10,120
Why are you screaming?

86
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:14,000
You're just the person.
Look at my face

87
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,400
-Oh gosh!
-Oh gosh?

88
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:27,160
This is not only bad.
It's extremely bad!

89
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:36,000
I told you long ago not to use
the celestial skills

90
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:38,000
Why didn't you heed my advice?

91
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,400
Let me take a look

92
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:47,000
What's that supposed to mean?
It can never be treated?

93
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,000
You got me into this mess...!

94
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:54,400
Stop it. I shook my head
because I didn't have the answer

95
00:08:54,400 --> 00:08:56,400
Who'd have it if you don't?

96
00:08:57,400 --> 00:09:00,160
Blame you for going against
heavenly rules again and again!

97
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:02,000
You tried to treat Shouquan
with your celestial skills

98
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:05,160
You'd only deplete
the celestial energy in you

99
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:10,000
Only a miracle will bring back
the charm and beauty you had

100
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,400
Trust you to be saying that!

101
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,400
Did you ever use the word "difficult"
when you asked me to come to earth?

102
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:19,400
You're the very person
responsible for my misery!

103
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:25,000
How did you know I had a boil here?
It's hurting!

104
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:28,400
Just what do you want me to do?

105
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,600
What other creams or lotions
you have up there?

106
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,400
I want you to bring all of them down

107
00:09:33,400 --> 00:09:38,120
The seven fairies had problems adapting
when they came down to earth

108
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:41,400
But they used the holy water
from the Celestial Pond to bath

109
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:46,000
And Goddess of Mercy's cooling dew
can be used to moisten the skin too

110
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:49,400
You may also choose to sneak into
Heavenly Queen Mother's night chamber...

111
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:51,000
and pinch her peach juice for me

112
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:54,400
Queen Mother told me that
if one applied the juice 3 times,

113
00:09:54,400 --> 00:09:58,160
one would become as charming
as peach blossoms within 7 days

114
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:03,800
Where are you, Zhang Guolao?!

115
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:11,160
Don't stand so far away.
Come over. I can't walk across!

116
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:19,400
To think you could ask me to steal
Goddess of Mercy's holy water...

117
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:21,400
and Queen Mother's peach juice

118
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:27,400
What if I'm discovered and condemned
to the mortal world,

119
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:29,400
am I to ask you to take me back?

120
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:34,400
-I got this face all because of you!
-I never did it

121
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:39,400
The ordeal Mei Shouquan went through
could make him a deity

122
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:42,000
Why did you save his life
with your celestial skills?

123
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,800
Not only did you prevent him
from becoming a deity,

124
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,400
you even got yourself hurt

125
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:53,160
-It was the spur of the moment
-The spur of the moment?

126
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:58,000
I reckon Mei Shouquan
must've touched your heart

127
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:02,000
It's fondness of the heart
rather than the spur of the moment

128
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:04,400
It isn't

129
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:10,400
Stop denying it or God of Plague
wouldn't have seen the opportunity

130
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:14,000
How would you drain your energy so fast
if you hadn't fallen for him?

131
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Don't you divert the issue.
What am I to do with my face?

132
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:22,000
-There is no cure for it?
-No. Just have more rest and sleep

133
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:25,400
You don't have to worry about
your face when you're sleeping

134
00:11:27,160 --> 00:11:29,800
It's been a long day.
I ought to go back

135
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,400
Hey, how can you leave just like that?

136
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:40,120
More rest and sleep?

137
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:06,400
-Shou!
-Mother...

138
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:11,000
-Come have your meal
-Don't worry. I'll have it later

139
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:16,400
Don't you get too obsessed.
You need to eat

140
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:19,400
You've not been in the best of health.
What if you're taken ill?

141
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:20,400
Come down!

142
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:25,160
Easy...

143
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:30,000
Mother, don't worry about me.
You'd better go home and rest

144
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:38,000
No parents aren't worried
about their children

145
00:12:40,880 --> 00:12:42,400
Eat it while it's hot

146
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:55,000
Mother, I'd like to be your son
in my next life if I had the choice

147
00:12:55,400 --> 00:13:02,000
I'd be strong and robust.
I'd repay your kindness

148
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:07,120
Fine, I look forward to that.
We'll be mother and son again

149
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:13,400
-Mother, a pity...
-Yes?

150
00:13:14,400 --> 00:13:18,000
I promised I'd come up with the pills
to save lives

151
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:22,160
But it's the second day today
and I'm nowhere near it

152
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:25,000
I fear I might not come up
with the drug

153
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:28,400
Master Shi will not let me off.
He'll kill my entire family

154
00:13:28,400 --> 00:13:32,000
-All of you may get implicated
-Don't get too distraught

155
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:36,000
Are you saying
you can do nothing at all?

156
00:13:37,160 --> 00:13:38,400
Yes

157
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:50,800
Why don't you leave this place
now that you still have time?

158
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:53,800
Go as far as you can.
Don't let them find you

159
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:59,120
How can I run off and leave you
all alone? I can't do that

160
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:04,000
You're the only son I have.
I don't want to see you harmed

161
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:08,000
I'd wanted you to do this long ago.
You'd better leave

162
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:11,400
At least our family will hold out
a glimmer of hope if you do that

163
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:15,000
Or beheading is what awaits you

164
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:20,400
Mother, rest assured I will produce
the drug in time for them to see

165
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:24,120
Dear, please heed my advice and leave!

166
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:29,400
Mother, do have faith in me.
Please go home and rest

167
00:14:56,400 --> 00:15:01,400
I thought Chief would come back
victorious when he went there himself

168
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:07,120
Chief turned out to be
so disappointing. He was defeated

169
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:13,120
-I think we have to plan our future
-Don't tell me you're quitting?

170
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:16,400
Birds would find
the best tree to rest;

171
00:15:16,400 --> 00:15:19,400
monkeys would disperse
when the tree falls

172
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:26,000
Yes, we should take refuge
before the tree falls on us!

173
00:15:27,400 --> 00:15:28,400
Stop there!

174
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:35,000
You're courting death, aren't you?!
Come here!

175
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:42,000
Please do not get angry, Master

176
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:45,120
Do not ever think I can't punish you
because I'm injured!

177
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:50,400
One swipe from me and I'll send you
reeling and eternally condemned!

178
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:55,000
Master, we won't dare repeat it

179
00:15:56,160 --> 00:16:01,400
Listen good. I have something
for you to do

180
00:16:02,000 --> 00:16:04,000
We're all ears, Master

181
00:16:04,000 --> 00:16:08,400
Mei Shouquan is working on
the pills in Ping'an

182
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:12,400
If he manages to do it
and save hundreds of lives,

183
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:18,160
Mei Shouquan will be hailed
for his lofty contribution

184
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:24,400
I will never give the three stars the
opportunity to become immortals again!

185
00:16:24,400 --> 00:16:27,160
Do you want us
to sabotage his effort?

186
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:32,400
But Ma-gu is there to protect him.
It won't be easy for us

187
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:40,120
You mustn't confront Ma-gu head-on.
It should be carried out on the sly

188
00:16:40,400 --> 00:16:42,120
We know what to do

189
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,400
We'll do it at once!

190
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:56,000
Gosh, it's the third day
and I seem to have produced nothing

191
00:16:56,800 --> 00:17:00,400
The entire family will be affected
if I don't produce the pills

192
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,000
What shall I do?

193
00:17:10,400 --> 00:17:13,400
Yes, it's time
you heeded your mother's advice

194
00:17:14,000 --> 00:17:17,000
Of all the options available,
quitting is the best one

195
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:20,400
Quitting?

196
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:27,000
I can't. The entire population
is waiting for my pills

197
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:30,000
Wouldn't I be very selfish
if I just quit?

198
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:33,000
Your time's running out.
To each his own!

199
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:35,400
Have you forgotten
what Magistrate Shi said?

200
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:41,000
Your entire family will be punished
if you can't come up with the pills

201
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:46,000
How can you implicate your mother
when she loves and dotes on you so much?

202
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:49,000
You'd better leave
or you won't have the time to do it

203
00:17:50,800 --> 00:17:57,000
No, I promised Miss Ma I'd produce
the pills and save lives

204
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,400
I'd be letting her down
if I simply quit

205
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:05,400
And Fu and Lu are my trusted buddies.
I can't bear to leave them

206
00:18:06,120 --> 00:18:11,000
My mother matters most to me.
She gave birth to me and brought my up

207
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:14,000
It would be very unfilial of me
if I were to leave her in the lurch

208
00:18:15,160 --> 00:18:18,000
Ma-gu, Fu and Lu are no kin of yours

209
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:21,000
You'd better leave now
or you'll run out of time!

210
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:24,400
Your mother will support you
if she knows of your decision

211
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:30,120
-Where on earth can I go?
-As faraway as you can

212
00:18:30,120 --> 00:18:31,800
The faster, the better!

213
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:31,800
Someone's trying to run away!
Go after them...!

214
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,400
Pretend that you didn't see me...

215
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:49,000
Where are you running off too?

216
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:52,000
Did Shi Yaoqian make your life
impossible?

217
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,400
Have you come up with the pills?

218
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:56,400
They'll kill my family
if I have nothing to show them today!

219
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:58,400
Don't stop me from leaving!

220
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:03,400
-Trust you to be running away!
-I don't want to harm my mother!

221
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:12,400
Do you bear to see the entire town
wiped out for not having the pills?

222
00:20:12,400 --> 00:20:14,120
Why don't you let me go?

223
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:16,400
Do you think that jerk will stop
haunting your mother?

224
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:23,000
And Miss Ma went through so much
to find the cauldron with you

225
00:20:23,000 --> 00:20:26,000
Don't you think you're doing her
a disservice by quitting now?

226
00:20:27,800 --> 00:20:32,400
It isn't the end of the world.
Why are you giving it up?

227
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,800
Do you want to have such low esteem...

228
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:38,160
that you'll never be able
to face the world again?!

229
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:45,000
We still have a few hours.
I'm sure a miracle will take place

230
00:20:45,000 --> 00:20:49,000
-I'll die with you if you face death
-Serious?

231
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:51,400
-I'll take you at your word
-Sure!

232
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:55,400
Buddy, you'll die with me
and we'll produce the pills together!

233
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:00,800
-Fu, come have a look
-I told you miracles could happen

234
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:05,000
Isn't this a pill cauldron?
How come it's a big lump?

235
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:10,400
Fret not.
I'll ask Ma-gu for you

236
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:12,800
Ma-gu's fainted

237
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:18,000
Mai Shouquan, His Excellency
will drag you to the yamen...

238
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:20,400
if you can't come up with the pills
within 4 hours!

239
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:24,400
Didn't you say 4 hours?
Come back in 4 hours!

240
00:21:41,160 --> 00:21:44,000
Since you refuse to leave,
we'll let you know what an ordeal is

241
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:53,000
How did the fire go out?

242
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:04,000
A bigger fire!
Please don't ruin my pills!

243
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:16,000
Please don't go out again!

244
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:27,400
Please don't go out again.
Hundreds of lives depend on you!

245
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:38,000
Feifei, shall we topple the cauldron?

246
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:53,400
Why did you topple the cauldron?

247
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:57,120
I don't know how it toppled

248
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:14,400
I've made it!
I've come up with the pills!

249
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:35,400
-Mei Shouquan, are these the pills?
-They are. I made them

250
00:23:36,800 --> 00:23:38,800
Will this pill cure my illness?

251
00:23:38,800 --> 00:23:44,000
According to the Manual of Deity
of Medicine, they will cure you

252
00:23:46,000 --> 00:23:47,400
Get me some water

253
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,400
Hold it, Your Excellency!

254
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:57,400
I'm told that Your Excellency has
a very good reputation among the people

255
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:04,400
It isn't uncommon for a good official
like Your Excellency to invite jealousy

256
00:24:05,400 --> 00:24:11,000
I'm afraid someone may try to kill
Your Excellency with this pill

257
00:24:12,800 --> 00:24:16,400
Mei Shouquan, how dare
you try to use this pill to harm me

258
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:21,120
Your Excellency,
that had never crossed my mind

259
00:24:21,120 --> 00:24:24,000
My main concern was to come up
with the pills and save lives

260
00:24:24,000 --> 00:24:26,400
Your Excellency, let him have one

261
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,160
Have one

262
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:34,800
Why should I have one
when I don't have the illness?

263
00:24:34,800 --> 00:24:36,400
I'll not have one if you don't

264
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:38,400
You made them.
You'd better have one!

265
00:24:38,400 --> 00:24:41,400
Won't it be a waste
if I take the pill for no good reason?

266
00:24:42,120 --> 00:24:43,200
I'll have it!

267
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:51,120
-I'll have it
-But you aren't ill!

268
00:24:52,400 --> 00:24:56,120
-I came to have one
-But you're neither ill nor injured

269
00:24:57,400 --> 00:25:00,120
-I trust you...
-Hold it!

270
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:07,400
Let me have it.
You aren't ill but I am

271
00:25:08,800 --> 00:25:13,000
-You mustn't take the risk
-I won't let you take the risk either

272
00:25:16,160 --> 00:25:19,120
Shuangxi, we'll die together
if we have to

273
00:25:22,000 --> 00:25:23,800
We'll die together if we have to

274
00:25:34,160 --> 00:25:36,120
Fu, how do you feel?

275
00:25:37,400 --> 00:25:39,400
Are you all right, Shuangxi?

276
00:25:45,400 --> 00:25:48,400
What's with you?
Shall I get you some water?

277
00:25:53,160 --> 00:25:56,400
Just as I expected, Your Excellency.
That is poison!

278
00:26:00,400 --> 00:26:03,000
How dare you try
to kill His Excellency!

279
00:26:03,800 --> 00:26:06,120
I didn't. I wonder
how it came to this

280
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:13,000
Mei Shouquan, how dare you try
to kill me! If I'd taken the pill...

281
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:17,120
I'm sorry. I'm no physician.
I brought this on you...

282
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:22,160
Men, take him away. I want every
member of his family beheaded!

283
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:35,400
Madam Mei, Mei Shouquan,
Shouquan's sister and Zhao Cai,

284
00:26:35,400 --> 00:26:39,000
you plotted to kill a senior official
of the Imperial Court

285
00:26:39,000 --> 00:26:42,160
The four of you are hereby sentenced
to be beheaded before the public!

286
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:44,800
Oh no, I'm scared of pain

287
00:26:44,800 --> 00:26:49,400
It's all right. One swipe
and you'll feel nothing!

288
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:51,120
Do it!

289
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:53,000
Hold it!

290
00:26:55,120 --> 00:26:58,000
Dear, you may be fierce to me...

291
00:26:59,160 --> 00:27:03,400
but you can't be nicer
when death is staring at us

292
00:27:04,160 --> 00:27:08,160
I had to be fierce with you
and I wasn't good to Jiujin either

293
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:12,400
I either beat her hard
or screamed at her. I truly regret it

294
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:16,400
I regret not treating
Jiujin or you better

295
00:27:17,000 --> 00:27:21,000
I didn't play my part
towards you and Jiujin either

296
00:27:21,400 --> 00:27:23,000
It's all my fault

297
00:27:23,400 --> 00:27:28,000
Not only are Fu and Shuangxi dead,
I've also got all of you affected

298
00:27:29,400 --> 00:27:31,000
I'm not a filial son

299
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:37,400
Mother, I'll never be able to repay
the kindness you've showered on me

300
00:27:38,400 --> 00:27:44,000
Let me be a beast of burden in my next
life to repay all that you've done for me

301
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:51,400
Son, I don't blame you. I don't want you
to be a beast of burden either

302
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:55,160
I still want you.
You're Mother's best son...

303
00:27:57,400 --> 00:28:00,000
-Do it!
-Hold it...!

304
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,400
What else do you want?

305
00:28:04,000 --> 00:28:09,000
Dear, I want to confess.
I had money stashed behind your back

306
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:13,000
So be it.
I'd like to confess too

307
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:18,400
I told you I ran into a bunch of
robbers the other time

308
00:28:19,160 --> 00:28:22,400
Fact is I lost the money in gambling

309
00:28:25,400 --> 00:28:28,000
I want them beheaded, now!

310
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:29,400
Hold it!

311
00:28:31,400 --> 00:28:33,160
Who is it this time?!

312
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:35,000
It's me!

313
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:39,000
How are you?

314
00:28:40,120 --> 00:28:41,160
I'm fine

315
00:28:56,400 --> 00:28:59,400
-Are you ghosts or what?
-We're humans, of course!

316
00:29:00,400 --> 00:29:03,400
-What's going on?
-I was puzzled too

317
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:07,400
After I took the pill, I felt a gush
of warm energy shooting upwards

318
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:10,400
I fell asleep after that.
No I'm so perked up!

319
00:29:11,000 --> 00:29:15,000
We were knocked out by the energy rush.
Now we're feeling much better

320
00:29:18,800 --> 00:29:26,000
I've got it. What you experienced
was a process of detoxication

321
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:31,000
You'd wake up and feel good
after the toxins are purged

322
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:38,000
You've even let the air out!

323
00:29:38,800 --> 00:29:42,400
Your Excellency, the drug works.
Let us go home!

324
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:46,000
We'll do them in!

325
00:29:46,800 --> 00:29:50,000
The drug works
since nothing's happened to them

326
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:54,400
I'm ill. Get me the pill
and let them go!

327
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:02,400
Mother, it's all over!

328
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:16,000
So Jiujin has recovered.
Time to play with Uncle again

329
00:30:16,400 --> 00:30:23,000
Jiujin might not have recovered
if we'd not got the pills made

330
00:30:24,400 --> 00:30:28,400
Uncle, when can I start addressing
Ruyi-jie as my auntie?

331
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:31,400
Very soon

332
00:30:32,400 --> 00:30:34,000
What's very soon?

333
00:30:35,160 --> 00:30:39,400
Nothing. Dinner's coming soon.
Go ask Mother if dinner's ready

334
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:52,400
How nice if I were to have
a daughter like Jiujin

335
00:30:53,400 --> 00:30:58,160
-I don't think you have a chance
-Why not?

336
00:30:58,400 --> 00:31:01,400
These are issues
you'd better not think about

337
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:05,000
Why can't I when marrying and having
children are part of life?

338
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:12,400
Oh, it's you.
Please come in

339
00:31:16,400 --> 00:31:21,000
-Ruyi, they came to visit you
-Nice to see all of you...

340
00:31:21,400 --> 00:31:24,000
Shou says you're injured.
Are you fine?

341
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:27,000
It's only a bruise.
You may go home

342
00:31:37,400 --> 00:31:39,800
It's all right.
Stop screaming!

343
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:43,400
She could've taken contaminated water.
That's why

344
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:48,800
She's really ugly!

345
00:31:49,400 --> 00:31:52,000
Not really.
I can make up who she is

346
00:31:57,400 --> 00:32:02,000
Sis, he didn't say that on purpose.
You aren't ugly at all

347
00:32:02,800 --> 00:32:03,800
Really?

348
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:10,400
Shi Yaoqian had been giving us
so much trouble

349
00:32:10,400 --> 00:32:13,400
Shouquan and his family
nearly paid the price

350
00:32:13,400 --> 00:32:16,400
Heaven won't protect mean characters
like Shi

351
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:19,000
If the Jade Emperor is discerning,

352
00:32:19,000 --> 00:32:22,160
we won't be seeing people
facing so much hardship and death

353
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:24,400
Fuqi, stop shooting your mouth off

354
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:29,120
I think what Fuqi said is right.
Let Jade Emperor hear your loud voice

355
00:32:29,120 --> 00:32:32,000
There is no fairness and justice
on earth

356
00:32:32,000 --> 00:32:35,400
You should know that a whisper on earth
is heard as thunder in Heaven

357
00:32:36,120 --> 00:32:39,400
You did something great in saving lives
with the pills you produced

358
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:44,400
Stop being so casual like you were
in the past. Be a good physician, get it?

359
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:45,400
I do

360
00:32:46,120 --> 00:32:49,000
Does it mean with the cauldron, you
can produce any kind of drugs you want?

361
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:52,000
Yes, in theory

362
00:32:53,000 --> 00:32:56,000
Shou might be able to think of ways
to treat the...

363
00:32:56,800 --> 00:32:59,800
That's right.
Why did it never cross my mind?

364
00:33:01,400 --> 00:33:07,000
Stop wasting your time. No medicine
will cure this face of mine

365
00:33:08,160 --> 00:33:10,400
No, I must cure you

366
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:14,800
I'd lose my appetite too when I see
you being troubled by the freckles

367
00:33:14,800 --> 00:33:18,000
I'd lose my sleep too
when you don't sleep well

368
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:19,800
I must cure you

369
00:33:21,000 --> 00:33:24,400
-What are you doing?
-It's so mushy

370
00:33:25,160 --> 00:33:27,120
-What is mushy?
-Is it mushy?

371
00:33:44,400 --> 00:33:49,400
Mei Shouquan, you succeeded in making
the pills and taming the epidemic

372
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:53,000
You've done a great job
in saving so many lives in this town

373
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:55,400
I must congratulate you
with a handsome reward!

374
00:33:56,120 --> 00:34:01,000
Your Excellency, I've just made a little
contribution - nothing to brag about

375
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:05,000
I do feel a little curious.
I'd like to ask you a question

376
00:34:05,400 --> 00:34:10,000
Go ahead, Your Excellency.
I'll tell you if I have the answer

377
00:34:10,400 --> 00:34:15,120
Since the cauldron is capable of making
pills, does it have any other uses?

378
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:17,000
Other uses?

379
00:34:17,400 --> 00:34:20,000
Can you make other kinds of drugs
with it?

380
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:23,000
Other kinds of drugs?
Your Excellency, you mean...

381
00:34:24,400 --> 00:34:30,000
Those which make you feel rejuvenated
or the elixir of life?

382
00:34:30,400 --> 00:34:35,120
I'm not sure if it's capable
of producing other kinds of drugs

383
00:34:35,800 --> 00:34:44,000
Our priority is to produce the pills
and use them to cure the masses

384
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:46,400
Those kinds of drugs can wait

385
00:34:48,160 --> 00:34:50,120
Crap! Crap!

386
00:34:51,000 --> 00:34:54,400
I just want to know if it's capable
of producing the elixir of life

387
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:58,000
As regards the plague,
I know what to do

388
00:34:58,400 --> 00:35:01,000
That's enough. You may go home

389
00:35:02,160 --> 00:35:04,400
Your Excellency,
I still have a small request

390
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:06,000
Yes?

391
00:35:06,400 --> 00:35:10,000
I'd like to take this cauldron with me
to produce more pills and drugs

392
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:14,400
What right have you
to take the cauldron with you?

393
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:20,160
I went through a great deal to bring
this cauldron back from Penglai Island

394
00:35:27,400 --> 00:35:29,000
Take him away!

395
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:35,800
-Are you trying to kill me?
-Scram!

396
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:39,000
Shi Yaoqian, stop playing big bully!

397
00:35:44,400 --> 00:35:47,000
Shi Yaoqian, open the door!

398
00:35:47,400 --> 00:35:49,400
Give the cauldron back to me!

399
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:52,400
Ruyi's waiting for me to cure her!

400
00:35:59,160 --> 00:36:01,400
Shi Yaoqian, open the door!

401
00:36:02,400 --> 00:36:05,000
Give me back the cauldron.
Let me treat Ruyi's face...

402
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:18,000
This is puzzling

403
00:36:19,160 --> 00:36:20,800
I've ploughed through
every one of them...

404
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:24,000
but there isn't any prescription
for treating freckles

405
00:36:24,400 --> 00:36:26,000
I can't believe this!

406
00:36:53,000 --> 00:36:55,400
The text is visible
only when it's wet!

407
00:37:03,160 --> 00:37:04,400
There is hope for Ruyi!

408
00:37:33,400 --> 00:37:36,000
What's happened to you?
Someone beat you?

409
00:37:36,400 --> 00:37:38,400
It's all right - only bruises

410
00:37:39,160 --> 00:37:43,400
-Who did it? Shi Yaoqian?
-Who else could it be?

411
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:48,400
That corrupt official didn't dare
beat me to death

412
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:52,120
Instead he took the cauldron from me.
I can't stomach that!

413
00:37:52,120 --> 00:37:53,400
How did it lead to that?

414
00:37:55,400 --> 00:38:00,000
I thought of using the cauldron
to treat your face

415
00:38:01,000 --> 00:38:04,000
Actually, it doesn't look so bad

416
00:38:05,160 --> 00:38:08,000
Don't be silly.
My face is a small problem

417
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:15,160
-It's okay even if it can't be cured
-But I promised I'd have it cured

418
00:38:16,400 --> 00:38:20,000
-Thank you
-Why be so formal with me?

419
00:38:20,400 --> 00:38:22,800
Do you still treat me like a stranger?

420
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:27,400
I found this line when I was reading
the Manual of Deity of Medicine

421
00:38:29,000 --> 00:38:32,400
It describes a cave
with a deity of medicine in it

422
00:38:32,400 --> 00:38:36,000
-Deity of Medicine? That old man...
-Do you know him?

423
00:38:37,000 --> 00:38:43,120
Since he is a long-time recluse,
he must be of certain age

424
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:48,000
Age aside, what matters is
he must be able to treat your face

425
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:51,400
We'll set off to find him
in a couple of days

426
00:38:54,400 --> 00:38:56,120
The cave is so far away

427
00:38:56,120 --> 00:39:00,000
Besides, we don't know if he is still
in there. We'd better call it off

428
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:04,000
I don't care how remote the chances are,
I must give it a try

429
00:39:04,400 --> 00:39:06,000
-But if...
-No buts

430
00:39:06,000 --> 00:39:08,800
You were the one who came to my rescue
every time I faced death

431
00:39:08,800 --> 00:39:12,160
I must do something for you
this time round

432
00:39:17,120 --> 00:39:21,000
Why did you drop in on me? Where are
you heading for with this bundle?

433
00:39:25,120 --> 00:39:28,400
Fu, I need you to do me a favour

434
00:39:29,160 --> 00:39:35,400
If one day I'm dead,
will you do this for me?

435
00:39:35,400 --> 00:39:38,160
Why did you say all this
for no rhyme or reason?

436
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:50,120
I've decided to find the deity
of medicine in the cave for Ruyi

437
00:39:50,400 --> 00:39:53,000
I will ask him to treat her face

438
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:59,160
But the journey is full of dangers,
I'm afraid...

439
00:40:00,120 --> 00:40:04,400
Why are you struggling with words?
Are you keeping something from me?

440
00:40:05,160 --> 00:40:07,120
-I'm not...
-Say that again!

441
00:40:08,000 --> 00:40:13,000
You don't tell lies. And you'd start
stammering the moment you do

442
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:15,400
-Serious?
-I'm serious

443
00:40:16,400 --> 00:40:21,000
I'll do nothing for you
if you don't tell me the truth

444
00:40:22,160 --> 00:40:25,400
Fu, don't go away.
I'll show you something

445
00:40:33,400 --> 00:40:36,400
"A cave of fortunes
where Deity of Medicine can be found

446
00:40:36,400 --> 00:40:40,000
"A life for a life
where the dead can be revived"

447
00:40:43,120 --> 00:40:46,120
Are you putting your life at stake
just to cure Miss Ma?

448
00:40:46,120 --> 00:40:50,400
I'm willing to do that
if Ruyi can be cured

449
00:40:52,120 --> 00:40:53,400
Is it worth the while?

450
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:59,000
You'd do the same for Shuangxi
if she's in trouble

451
00:41:00,000 --> 00:41:01,400
You're right

452
00:41:02,400 --> 00:41:06,400
State your request.
I will do you the favour

453
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:10,120
My brother-in-law, Zhao Cai,
has a loose tongue...

454
00:41:10,120 --> 00:41:12,120
and my sister
puts money before everything else

455
00:41:12,120 --> 00:41:14,880
I don't feel good
if they're to take care of my mother

456
00:41:14,880 --> 00:41:19,000
Say no more. Leave everything to me.
If you fail to return this time round,

457
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:22,000
rest assured I'll treat your mother
like my own

458
00:41:24,000 --> 00:41:26,000
Thank you very much, my buddy...

459
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:28,800
My dear brother!

460
00:41:51,400 --> 00:41:54,000
Shou, what are you doing?

461
00:41:58,400 --> 00:42:00,400
Where are you heading off to?

462
00:42:01,400 --> 00:42:05,160
You just came back from a long journey.
Are you going away again?

463
00:42:08,400 --> 00:42:13,000
Sister, I had this tonic wine
I concocted myself

464
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:17,000
You know that Mother is often in pain
whenever there is rain

465
00:42:17,000 --> 00:42:19,400
Don't forget to apply this on Mother

466
00:42:21,400 --> 00:42:27,400
Brother, please take good care of
Sister and Mother when I'm not around

467
00:42:28,800 --> 00:42:33,800
Fancy you giving me another one when
your sister is already a handful to me

468
00:42:35,400 --> 00:42:40,000
Here is some money
in case you need it

469
00:42:45,400 --> 00:42:51,400
Actually, we're one family. How can I
not take good care of Mother?

470
00:42:51,800 --> 00:42:53,120
Don't you worry

471
00:42:55,120 --> 00:42:57,400
Shou, just where are you going?

472
00:42:58,000 --> 00:43:03,120
Don't tell me you're looking for some
cauldron and making some drugs again?

473
00:43:04,400 --> 00:43:06,800
For goodness' sake,
please don't repeat it

474
00:43:06,800 --> 00:43:11,000
We all nearly lost our lives
when you couldn't produce the pills

475
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:14,400
I suggest you stay at home
and stop having fantasies

476
00:43:15,160 --> 00:43:20,000
You must tell me the truth if this is
another risk-taking journey

477
00:43:21,000 --> 00:43:23,400
Yeah, Brother, don't be rash

478
00:43:24,000 --> 00:43:26,000
Not to worry, Mother

479
00:43:26,400 --> 00:43:29,000
I'm going to visit
a highly-skilled physician...

480
00:43:29,000 --> 00:43:32,400
who will cure Miss Ma's freckles

481
00:43:32,400 --> 00:43:34,400
There won't be any risk

482
00:43:35,400 --> 00:43:37,400
So you're doing it for Miss Ma

483
00:43:38,160 --> 00:43:41,160
I feel better so long as
there is no risk involved

484
00:43:42,400 --> 00:43:45,400
Mother, rest assured I'm no longer
the boy I used to be;

485
00:43:45,400 --> 00:43:52,000
the weakling who couldn't withstand
the rigours of long-distance journey

486
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:55,000
I'm now as robust as anybody else!

487
00:43:56,400 --> 00:44:03,000
To me, you're always that little boy

488
00:44:12,400 --> 00:44:20,000
Mother, I want so much to hear the way
you called me when I was still a boy

489
00:44:20,800 --> 00:44:22,400
Darling...

490
00:44:25,400 --> 00:44:26,480
Subtitles: H Yap


